@Ringly.Samples.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Create a queue
POST {{Ringly.Samples.WebApi_HostAddress}}/queues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "support"
}

### Provision a client
POST {{Ringly.Samples.WebApi_HostAddress}}/clients/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/provision

### Start a call between two known parties
POST {{Ringly.Samples.WebApi_HostAddress}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partyAExtension": "1000",
  "partyBExtension": "1001"
}

### Route a cold support request into a queue (needs a prior /provision call for this clientId)
POST {{Ringly.Samples.WebApi_HostAddress}}/support/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/route?queueName=support
